                "!F:d6f5a3ee-a2ad-4345-9b89-cff6108d7680!Would they be like, \n\"Earth go hard\"??  @",
                "!F:d6f5a3ee-a2ad-4345-9b89-cff6108d7680!Or is it just another\nconquest?"
